---
import HomeHero from '../assets/bw-lights.png';
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import { SITE_DESCRIPTION, SITE_TITLE } from '../consts';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<BaseHead title={SITE_TITLE} description={SITE_DESCRIPTION} />
		<style>
			.hero-image {
				width: 100%;
				margin-bottom: 4rem;
			}
			.hero-image img {
				display: block;
				margin: 0 auto;
				border-radius: 0px;
			}
		</style>
	</head>
	<body>
		<Header />
		<main>
			<div class="hero-image">
				<img width={HomeHero.width} height={HomeHero.height} src={HomeHero.src} />
			</div>
			<p>
				Welcome to my little corner of the Internet. This is a place where I post experiments and personal projects that I'm working
				on. Mostly simple P5JS sketches, that I'm recreating from Processing sketches I developed back in the day.
			</p>
			<p>
				My intention with building these is to stick to building by hand without AI support. I always enjoyed the practice of
				building these little experiments and I want to rediscover that at a time when so much coding is being handed off to machines.
			</p>
			<p>
				The pieces I've built are hanging out in the <a href="/sketches">Sketches</a> section of the site. Find me on the social links
				in the menu if you have any questions or comments about them.
			</p>
		</main>
		<Footer />
	</body>
</html>
